     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi D-RUG folks,<div><br></div><div>Would have like to get this off earlier, but I am still planning on giving a short 20 min presentation on using the <b><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">sf</font></b> package for spatial analysis in R tomorrow during our usual work session (<i>10am-12pm, DSI 360</i>). We&#39;ll screencast here: <b><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=taY6GrZ6vzE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DtaY6GrZ6vzE&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466646442000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2P5NzWd39fyi-hqOZeCC9R\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=taY6GrZ6vzE</a></b></div><div><br></div><div>If you are interested in spatial tools/mapping in R, I&#39;m working on updating this site, which is what I used during the <a href=\"https://youtu.be/pYeopQFtlIQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://youtu.be/pYeopQFtlIQ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466646442000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ckG8IfYWRq0HReaFRIUBV\">#maptime presentation</a> this past monday. Have comments/questions/things to add? Let me know! </div><div><ul><li><b><a href=\"https://ryanpeek.github.io/mapping_in_R/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ryanpeek.github.io/mapping_in_R/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466646442000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ar5K4_sbq_N2a7e9wYztI\">https://ryanpeek.github.io/mapping_in_R/</a></b></li></ul></div><div>It&#39;s by no means comprehensive, but it&#39;s a start. Just know it&#39;s living document for the time being, but please check it out. I need to add links to existing vignettes, and I&#39;ll try to keep adding resources, posts, etc. as things progress. </div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><u><b><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">PACKAGE OF THE WEEK:</font></b></u></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Currently there are <b>11, 936</b> </span>total packages on <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(102,17,204);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466646442000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PyxKLWmqEoBexjjLMgUU0\">CRAN</a>. </font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">A few more spatial packages to check out. I talked about this Monday at the #Maptime meeting, but definitely check out them out if you are interested in dynamic webmaps like leaflet (which these packages use). If you think of something, please add to the <a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/VzzeldnaEOkNImJ73\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/VzzeldnaEOkNImJ73&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466646442000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fJGpLE3UEmSkW_g-9gVjy\">google form</a>.</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><ul><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><b><a href=\"https://r-spatial.github.io/mapview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://r-spatial.github.io/mapview/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466646442000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kDn9-h_JUaTIhqaA2OS6k\">mapview</a></b></font></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><b><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tmap/vignettes/tmap-nutshell.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tmap/vignettes/tmap-nutshell.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466646442000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HsgnnU2NzdD3jEq34DmK-\">tmap</a></b></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><b><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggmap/ggmap.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggmap/ggmap.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466646442000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LWc13_QV9nuH0a0FY1yWj\">ggmap</a></b></li></ul></div><div><br></div><div>Hasta mañana!</div><div><br></div><div>Ryan</div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-inden